  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(error): populate source locations in arcanist/sarif output by @Peefy in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2217\n* ci(release): publish kcl-lib for windows/arm64 by @Peefy in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2219\n* fix(ci): stop three doctests sharing a mutable fixture by @Peefy in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2220\n* fix(lsp): keep completion on an attribute name typed before its `:` or `=` by @jul-m in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2221\n* chore(release): bump version to v0.13.2 by @Peefy in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2222\n\n## New Contributors\n* @jul-m made their first contribution in https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/pull/2221\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kcl-lang/kcl/compare/v0.13.1...v0.13.2",
